{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18301850","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18301850","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1830185001:1":{"text":"어? 분장 차례를 기다리시는 건가요? 저쪽에서 잠시만 기다려 주세요. 맡은 배역이 뭔지 알려 주시면 금방 끝내고 해 드릴게요.","source_cn":"哦？要排妆吗？请在那边稍等一下，告诉我你是哪个角色，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0811F144882C9476","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830185002:1":{"text":"세상에, 마사, 코가 너무 간지러워요. 긁으면 안 돼요?","source_cn":"哦，天哪，玛萨，我的鼻子好痒啊。我可以自己挠挠吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C79BC269DAFE0CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830185003:1":{"text":"안 돼요. 어디가 간지러운지 말하면 두드려 줄게요.","source_cn":"不可以。哪里痒告诉我，我帮你拍一拍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7961EC47FD4FA6AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1830185004:1":{"text":"이번 공연은 정말 중요해요! 반드시 가장 완벽한 분장을 해야 한다고요!","source_cn":"这次的演出很重要！在正式演出之前，我必须帮你找到最完美...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A9C7C4838106975","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1830185005:1":{"text":"아, 알았어요... 저도 세니아 님이랑 같은 무대에 서는 건 처음이니까, 최대한 완벽하게 보이고 싶긴 해요.","source_cn":"啊，好吧……这也是我第一次跟塞涅小姐同台演出，我也希望...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44ED7ED8F3805827","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1830185006:1":{"text":"긴장돼요?","source_cn":"紧张吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDA8226373BFE8C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1830185007:1":{"text":"솔직히 말해도 돼요? 조금...","source_cn":"说实话吗？有点……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5F6226B48FA05C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:玛萨":{"text":"마사","source":"玛萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:麦失":{"text":"마일스","source":"麦失","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}